  "id": "cf-hero-drew",
  "title": "Drew",
  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "Four named rounds, each for a crew member killed in a 2025 MH-60M Black Hawk crash, with runs growing from 200 to 800 m against shrinking sets of pull-ups and hand-release push-ups plus 4 deadlifts at 1.5x bodyweight, then 269 step-ups for the 160th SOAR Night Stalkers, in a weight vest. Honours Chief Warrant Officer 3 Andrew \"Drew\" Cully and his crew, killed near Joint Base Lewis-McChord in 2025. Scale the deadlift to bodyweight.",
